        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在數位世界中，密碼就像您個人寶箱的鑰匙，但讓我們面對現實，它們更像是一堆您需要時找不到但其他人不知何故可以找到的便利貼。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "我們能在某種程度上消除密碼嗎？",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "是的，使用 Passkeys。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Passkey 是一種用於保護對各種線上服務和帳戶的存取的驗證方法。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "它是一個唯一的金鑰對，由為個別使用者專門生成的公鑰和私鑰組成",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "...",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "簡而言之，使用您的手機或指紋裝置與生物識別來驗證您的登入。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "在採用 Passkeys 之前，您可以在 https://www.passkeys.io/ 上進行試用。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "記得閱讀 https://www.passkeys.io/#How-to-use-a-passkey 的說明。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以為同一帳戶在多個裝置上建立 passkey。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "以下示範在具有指紋感應器和 Windows Hello 的 Windows 上執行。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "您可以在行動裝置上獲得相同的體驗。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "像許多應用程式一樣，您需要先建立一個帳戶。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "大多數網站會要求您設定密碼以讓您感到舒適。",
      "sourceRef": {
        "type": "post",
        "id": "passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security",
        "title": "Passkeys - 您通往無縫安全的門戶",
        "url": "/zh-TW/blog/passkeys-your-gateway-to-seamless-security/"
      }
